    {
      "text": "Hi Priya, Maya with HyperSale. I noticed Meridian\u2019s recent sales hiring push\u2014can I take 30 seconds to explain why I called, then you decide?",
      "llm_ms": 5395,
      "end": false,
      "audio_s": 10.06
    },
    {
      "text": "We help new reps practise freight buyer calls with AI roleplays, while managers track progress through quote-backed scoring. How are you handling ramp today?",
      "llm_ms": 3591,
      "end": false,
      "audio_s": 9.98
    },
    {
      "text": "Got it. Where do ride-alongs fall short today\u2014manager time, consistency, or reps getting enough practice before live calls?",
      "llm_ms": 3858,
      "end": false,
      "audio_s": 8.28
