    {
      "text": "Fair question\u2014I\u2019m selling AI call practice, and I\u2019m asking about manager time to see if it\u2019s relevant. Can I ask two more questions?",
      "llm_ms": 4918,
      "end": false,
      "audio_s": 8.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks. Roughly how many manager hours per week go into ride-alongs across the team?",
      "llm_ms": 4672,
      "end": false,
      "audio_s": 5.84
    },
    {
      "text": "That adds up. When managers lose those five hours, what tends to suffer most\u2014coaching existing reps, forecasting, or something else?",
      "llm_ms": 4040,
      "end": false,
      "audio_s": 9.62
    },
    {
      "text": "That\u2019s where HyperSale may help: reps practice independently, and managers review quote-backed scores instead of every ride-along. Worth a 20-minute look with your enablement lead?",
